 ## 1. Brief
 
 - Prompt (verbatim): [prompts/persona-beta-2-18-24.md](prompts/persona-beta-2-18-24.md).
+
+## Working notes (to be folded into the sections below)
+
+### P1. Mei Lin Tan, 21, student, Waterloo (Canada), iPhone 13 mini 375x812, then the same phone turned sideways (812x375)
+
+- Goal: "A summer 2027 software internship at Amazon, Google or Microsoft in Canada. What does it pay a month, and does a Vancouver summer leave at least CA$1,500 a month after rent?"
+- Cold arrival: the page opens on Google, with "melon·seek · Beta: adds 7 big-tech careers sites" and "$199K base pay median (US)". It is clear that this is big tech and pay.
+- Amazon: the switch takes 2.7–4.0 s (load 4–8). "intern" gives 487 roles. Location → Vancouver gives 3 roles.
+- Mistake: the Location chip opens the sheet with the Department section's search box at the top. Typing "Vancouver" there gives "No matches" (p1-05a).
+- Stats line: "$72K base pay median" over CA$ cards (BN-2).
+- SDE Intern drawer:
+  - Pay: "CA$101K · CAD · per year · ≈ $72K", "This one among 6 internships at Amazon", "Pays more than 40% of Amazon's internships" (the 6 are Canada's).
+  - Department: "Administrative Support · Software Development" (Amazon's own category).
+  - Same role elsewhere: "Nothing to compare yet in Canada".
+  - Juice: $1,740/mo for one person, 1-bedroom; the tax row says "state or local tax" for BC.
+  - The "Reopened where you left off" toast covers the Juice line.
+- Google: the switch keeps "intern" and Vancouver, which gives 0 roles. "Remove the location filter" brings back 92.
+  - Location "Canada" lists Montreal, Toronto and Waterloo (IM-9 fixed); each city must be ticked.
+  - Cards: "CA$120K/year · 12–14-week internship" (BF-2 fixed). All of Google's Canadian interns are PhD students.
+- Microsoft: "Kept 'intern', Montreal, Toronto · dropped Waterloo (not at Microsoft) for now".
+  - Cards: CA$9,150–10,170/month (12 weeks) and CA$44K–50K/year (26 weeks), clear.
+  - The data-centre intern's Juice is "0 · Rind".
+- Insights: "$88K US dollars a year", low confidence, 4 roles. The Location select lists about 300 places.
+- Save: "Saved in this browser…". Coming back sideways: it reopens at once, the saved search is in the menu, and the map pin reads "$72K · 5" in Toronto.
